From 82aa3f8e41daab02ac66803ad086d5af33549fd0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 22:24:37 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Add vanna/charm positioning and short-squeeze alert to Score
 & regime tab

- vanna_charm.py: dealer vanna/charm hedge flow from the chain (OTM puts as the
  headline, OTM calls as a +/- range, selectable convention), IV-drop scenarios,
  by-strike and by-expiry breakdowns, and a none/watch/armed/alert squeeze checklist
  with the history-file hit rates for the same trigger.
- core.py: parse vanna/charm columns, add R["vanna_charm"] / R["squeeze"], extend the
  snapshot log; CORE_VERSION and app.py EXPECTED_CORE bumped to 2026-11-21.1.
- app.py: alert banner under the headline metrics, "Vanna & charm positioning" and
  "Short-squeeze checklist" sections, sidebar expander for thresholds.
- chat_tab.py: include the new section in the chat context.
- test_vanna_charm.py: sign/convention, alert-level and real-file checks.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011aDvGNmaZkPhi8CpwJMXsw
